From 55cbcd93f8569b9daf970087268a33c227c76394 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 21:39:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Select one post-run visual from the recorded night packet

A run card now keeps a single result, one named SVG, and at most three source-bound facts. The four-project night packet draws Fleet Relay. Series the capture does not store stay unmapped.
---
