 agentgrinder/visual_select.py | 793 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_visual_select.py   | 195 +++++++++
 3 files changed, 1004 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 agentgrinder/visual_select.py
 create mode 100644 tests/test_visual_select.py

